From: Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix build with -Werror=return-type in StylePickerTool

StylePickerTool::onPropertyChanged() falls off the end without
returning a value when the property matches neither of the two
handled names. Restore the trailing `return true` 1.7.1 had.

---
 toonz/sources/tnztools/stylepickertool.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/toonz/sources/tnztools/stylepickertool.cpp
+++ b/toonz/sources/tnztools/stylepickertool.cpp
@@ -321,6 +321,7 @@
     }
     return true;
   }
+  return true;
 }
 
 /* Check if the organizing operation is available */

